While wielding a two handed weapon, your critical strike chance is increased by [3%, 5%, 6%, 8%, 10% (TL1-5)], and your melee criticals instill you with righteous strength, increasing all physical and light damage you deal by [5%, 8%, 10%, 13%, 15% (TL1-5)], stacking up to 3 times.

In addition, your melee critical strikes leave a lasting lightburn on the target, dealing [71, 96, 115, 131, 145 (TL1-5; SP 100)] light damage over 5 turns and reducing opponents armour by [5, 13, 19, 25, 30 (TL1-5)].

The damage increases with your Spellpower.
